<title>TURKEY: TABLE -- Turkey's revised 1997 economic targets. [CORRECTED 15:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>TABLE -- Turkey's revised 1997 economic targets. [CORRECTED 15:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey revised its 1997 economic targets, Finance Minister Zekeriya Temizel said.</p>
<p>			     Initial Target		Revised</p>
<p>			     --------------	     -------------</p>
<p>    GNP		    25,360 trillon lira     27,812 trillion</p>
<p>			     $187,852 million		$189,197 million</p>
<p>    GNP growth rate     4 pct			5.5-6 pct</p>
<p>    GNP deflator	  65 pct		     75-80 pct</p>
<p>    WPI annual average  65 pct		     75-80 pct</p>
<p>    WPI year-on-year    57.7 pct		   80-85 pct</p>
<p>    Average lira/dollar    135,000		 147,000-150,000</p>
<p>					  (Corrects from 147,000-159,000)</p>
<p>    Exports		 $29.5 billion	    $25.5-26 billion</p>
<p>    Imports		 $50 billion		$45.5-46 billion</p>
<p>    For.Trade deficit   $20.5 billion	    $20 billion</p>
<p>    C/A deficit	   $5.6 billion	     $4-4.5 billion</p>
</text>
